# E-Commerce Project Walkthrough

## What Was Built

### Frontend (`frontend/`)
React + Vite app with Bootstrap UI:
- **Login** / **Signup** pages with role-based navigation
- **AdminDashboard** — product table with Add/Update/Delete
- **CustomerDashboard** — product cards with Buy button
- **AddProduct** / **UpdateProduct** — form pages
- Hardcoded admin: `2410030124@klh.edu.in` / `admin124`

### Backend (`backend/`)
Spring Boot 3.2.5 + MySQL + Spring Security:
- **Models**: [Product.java](file:///Users/david/antigravity/backend/src/main/java/com/klu/model/Product.java), [User.java](file:///Users/david/antigravity/backend/src/main/java/com/klu/model/User.java) (JPA entities)
- **Repositories**: [ProductRepository](file:///Users/david/antigravity/backend/src/main/java/com/klu/repository/ProductRepository.java#6-8), [UserRepository](file:///Users/david/antigravity/backend/src/main/java/com/klu/repository/UserRepository.java#6-9)
- **Services**: [ProductService](file:///Users/david/antigravity/backend/src/main/java/com/klu/service/ProductService.java#9-52) (CRUD), [UserService](file:///Users/david/antigravity/backend/src/main/java/com/klu/service/UserService.java#7-31) (login/signup)
- **Controllers**: [ProductController](file:///Users/david/antigravity/backend/src/main/java/com/klu/controller/ProductController.java#9-53) (`/api/products`), [AuthController](file:///Users/david/antigravity/backend/src/main/java/com/klu/controller/AuthController.java#7-30) (`/api/auth`)
- **Config**: [SecurityConfig](file:///Users/david/antigravity/backend/src/main/java/com/klu/config/SecurityConfig.java#8-23) (CSRF disabled, all requests permitted)
- **Port**: `8081`

## Validation
- ✅ Frontend compiles and runs on `http://localhost:5173/`
- ✅ Backend compiles successfully with `mvn compile`

## To Run
1. **Update MySQL password** in [backend/src/main/resources/application.properties](file:///Users/david/antigravity/backend/src/main/resources/application.properties)
2. Create the database: `CREATE DATABASE ecommerce_db;`
3. Insert admin: `INSERT INTO ecommerce_db.users (name, email, password, role) VALUES ('siva', 'siva@gmail.com', '4321', 'ADMIN');`
4. Start backend: `cd backend && mvn spring-boot:run`
5. Start frontend: `cd frontend && npm run dev`
